## 1.2.0

```
Auto Quick Deposit - now starts before your backpack is full: when loot leaves fewer free slots than Auto Deposit Free Slots (new setting, 5 by default), so several items looted at once no longer spill into your hotbar. Set it to 1 for the old behavior.
Auto Salvage - waits until a looted piece's level and rarity have settled before salvaging it. It no longer salvages gear read as level 0 Common for too few runes, and loot-level mods have time to set the level first.
```

## 1.1.0

```
Catch-all chest - name a chest All and it takes any item that no other chest's name asks for, or whose chests are full. All is first in the rename dropdown, and Auto-Name Chests never uses it.
Crafting - crafting from linked chests now works in every crafting menu without Cross-Base Storage, even next to Building Tools.
Fill Stations From Linked Chests - new setting, on by default. A production station's +1 and +10 also take from your linked chests.
Lockpicks From Linked Chests - new setting, on by default. A lock that needs a lockpick opens with one held in a linked chest. With Kiln 0.2.0-dev.31.15 or newer, the lock's Required: Lockpick line also turns green.
Build From Linked Chests - new setting, on by default. The Construction Hammer and the build menu will count and use blocks and materials from your linked chests once Kiln ships its fix. It does nothing yet.
Auto-Stations - removed. Stations now fill from your linked chests by themselves, so the Auto-Stations chests and their settings are gone. A chest named Auto-Stations is now an ordinary chest.
Repair Kit - can now be used from the window like other consumables.
Requirements - now needs Kiln 0.2.0-dev.31.12 or newer.
```

## 1.0.0

```
First release.
